WEBVTT

00:04:59.875 --> 00:05:01.934
"Nice, but does it scale?

00:05:01.958 --> 00:05:04.351
Sure, a return to traditional
farming methods

00:05:04.375 --> 00:05:05.809
could produce better food,

00:05:05.833 --> 00:05:08.559
but can it produce enough food
that's affordable?"

00:05:08.583 --> 00:05:11.518
The rift between the reinvention camp
and the deinvention camp

00:05:11.542 --> 00:05:13.268
has existed for decades.

00:05:13.292 --> 00:05:17.184
But now it's a raging battle.

00:05:17.208 --> 00:05:18.643
One side covets the past,

00:05:18.667 --> 00:05:20.518
the other side covets the future

00:05:20.542 --> 00:05:23.059
and as someone observing this
from the outside,

00:05:23.083 --> 00:05:26.268
I began to wonder,
why must it be so binary?

00:05:26.292 --> 00:05:29.101
Can't there be a synthesis
of the two approaches?

00:05:29.125 --> 00:05:33.809
Our challenge is to borrow
from the wisdom of the ages,